  "details": "This is just in case Vrchat doesn't get me email.\n\nSo it has been brought to my attention that even though Vrchat is a 13+ app that people can freely use, there is just one thing that Vrchat fails to do. Keeping the fully grown adults that also play safe, making it more child friendly when Adults are also playing. I myself is an adult and I don't really agree to mixing with a bunch of kids. However making it more child friendly is a bigger issue and Adults playing will surely have the review of the game drop, meaning the adults who are playing will end up never coming back to the game. \n\nanother problem is the kids under the age of 13+, Vrchat just doesn't seem to know or care about the number of children that play the game who's brains are still developing. I dont really have any Photo proof of this because I'm speaking for all Adults who still play Vrchat, Bottom line is Vrchat needs to do better at making more Adult friendly and Keeping children out of the game.",
